      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "At 1273 K, the baseline TiVNbTa alloy has approximately 330 MPa yield strength and 423 MPa compressive strength at 30% strain.",
